        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Derelict House with Stone Outbuilding on circa 1.5 Acres\n\nOffered for sale by private treaty, this rural property comprises of a derelict residence together with a traditional stone outbuilding, standing on approximately 1.5 acres.\n\nFeatures include:\n* Slated roof\n* Traditional stone outbuilding\n* Circa 1.5-acre site\n* Additional land available if required\n* Rural setting\n* Located just 2 km from Ballintogher\n* Approximately 14 km from Sligo\n\nThis property offers an excellent opportunity for restoration and redevelopment, with the added benefit of further adjoining land being available by separate negotiation. Conveniently situated close to local amenities while enjoying a rural setting, it has the potential to be a distinctive country home or investment project.\n\nThe property should qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant Scheme (subject to terms conditions) - check government websites for further details under vacant property refurbishment grants."
      },
